  "stem": "A helicopter is flying horizontally with a speed v at an altitude h has to drop a food packet for a man on the ground. What is the distance of the helicopter from the man when the food packet is dropped?",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{2ghv^{2} + 1}{h^{2}}}$",
    "B": "$\\sqrt{2ghv^{2} + h^{2}}$",
    "C": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{2v^{2}h}{g} + h^{2}}$",
    "D": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{2v^{2}h}{g}} + h^{2}$"
  },
  "answer": {
    "keys": [
      "C"
    ]
  },
